# K03 (Codex K03-S5-ALIAS-VISIBILITY-20261007-07 Q2; docs/LMX_semantics.en.md:768, :937): a method's signature
# names a named Structure the unit defines BELOW the method -- a named Structure is a callable procedure, visible
# throughout its block in both directions (the S2 reading refused it as a non-callable: unknown type).  take reads
# its formal's field.  Exit 7; 81 when the formal reached another place.
fn: take (Point: p) size_t
    return: p\x
end: take
Point:
    size_t: x 5U
end: Point
fn: m () int
    pt: merge: Point
    pt\x: 7U
    if: take(pt) != 7U
        return: 81
    return: 7
end: m
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: m(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
